agent-ops task task-6d2b7ae8-b355-4b16-8bf7-09a44c540777: Stop run coordinator busy-polling
intent: Recover reviewed-design commits 660405c and bdbadc8 (lost to an accidental reset): coordinator yields only after an explicit action=wait request (all jobs values), frees its slot, and wakes on a fresh native session after all children are delivered/complete/blocked; run status/logs JSON drop events and goal.
criteria:
- wait-yields: A coordinator action=wait request with pending children stops the coordinator (confirmed death, slot freed, RUN_COORDINATOR_WAITING) for jobs=1 and jobs=2; wait from a child or with no pending child is rejected.
- no-forced-yield: Without a wait request the scheduler never stops an active coordinator while children are pending, for jobs=1 and jobs=2.
- fresh-wake: A yielded coordinator is not restarted (schedule or recovery) while children are pending; once all are delivered/complete/blocked it restarts with cleared native thread ids so the transport starts a fresh session, and its instructions diagnostic lists each child status.
- slim-status: run status and run logs --json state omit events and goal and include eventCount and goalHash; run logs still returns events.
- docs-instructions: Coordinator instructions tell it to send wait after planning workers; loop-engineering and harness-adapters specs (en and zh-TW) and CHANGELOG describe the new behavior, and npm test passes.
